From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PickleHik3 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/16] subprojects: gmobile v0.6.0_beta1 and feedbackd v0.8.1

The wraps in the tag name gmobile v0.1.0 and feedbackd v0.7.0, the oldest versions phosh's
meson accepts. 0.58 is written for what phoc 0.58 builds against, gmobile v0.6.0_beta1, and
for feedbackd 0.8. libhandy is taken from the sysroot, so its wrap stays as it is.
---
 subprojects/gmobile.wrap     | 2 +-
 subprojects/libfeedback.wrap | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/subprojects/gmobile.wrap b/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
index b9ec8e9..d5fe74b 100644
--- a/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
+++ b/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 [wrap-git]
 directory=gmobile
 url=https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/gmobile.git
-revision=v0.1.0
+revision=v0.6.0_beta1
 depth=1
diff --git a/subprojects/libfeedback.wrap b/subprojects/libfeedback.wrap
index 0827dc9..483163b 100644
--- a/subprojects/libfeedback.wrap
+++ b/subprojects/libfeedback.wrap
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 [wrap-git]
 directory=feedbackd
 url=https://source.puri.sm/Librem5/feedbackd.git
-revision=v0.7.0
+revision=v0.8.1
